### Test dual authentication on selected endpoints.
### Assuming the folowing in  appsettings.jon:
###    "PrivateApiAuthentication":  "Token",
###    "PrivateApiAdditionalAuthenticationMethods": {
###        "/api/private/allDataTypesCookie": "Cookie"
###    },

### Cookie-enabled endpoint: cookie (expected 200)
// @no-cookie-jar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/private/allDataTypesCookie
Cookie: .AspNetCore.Identity.Application={{authCookie}}

### Cookie-enabled endpoint: token (expected 200)
// @no-cookie-jar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/private/allDataTypesCookie
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Cookie-enabled endpoint: no credentials (expected 401)
// @no-cookie-jar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/private/allDataTypesCookie

### Token-only endpoint: cookie (expected 401)
// @no-cookie-jar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/private/link-report
Cookie: .AspNetCore.Identity.Application={{authCookie}}

### Token-only endpoint: token (expected 200)
// @no-cookie-jar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/private/link-report
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Token-only endpoint: no credentials (expected 401)
// @no-cookie-jar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/private/link-report
